<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Finora AI - PPT Presentation Content Guide</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: 'Calibri', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #1a1a2e; margin: 40px; line-height: 1.65; }
  h1 { font-size: 22pt; color: #0f3460; border-bottom: 3px solid #e94560; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 30px; }
  h2 { font-size: 15pt; color: white; background: #0f3460; padding: 10px 16px; border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 30px; }
  h3 { font-size: 13pt; color: #e94560; margin-top: 20px; font-weight: bold; }
  h4 { font-size: 11pt; color: #0f3460; margin-top: 12px; }
  .slide-box {
    border: 2px solid #0f3460; border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px 24px;
    margin: 20px 0; background: #f8faff;
  }
  .slide-number {
    display: inline-block; background: #e94560; color: white; border-radius: 50%;
    width: 30px; height: 30px; line-height: 30px; text-align: center;
    font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt; margin-right: 10px; vertical-align: middle;
  }
  .slide-title { font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; color: #0f3460; vertical-align: middle; }
  .slide-type { font-size: 9pt; color: #888; float: right; font-style: italic; margin-top: 5px; }
  .bullet-main { font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; color: #16213e; margin: 10px 0 4px 0; }
  .bullet-sub { font-size: 10.5pt; color: #444; margin: 2px 0 2px 22px; }
  .tag { display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 9pt; font-weight: bold; margin-right: 5px; }
  .tag-ai { background: #d1fae5; color: #065f46; }
  .tag-tech { background: #dbeafe; color: #1e40af; }
  .tag-biz { background: #fce7f3; color: #9d174d; }
  .tag-feature { background: #fff7ed; color: #9a3412; }
  table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 12px 0; font-size: 10.5pt; }
  th { background: #0f3460; color: white; padding: 8px 12px; text-align: left; }
  td { padding: 7px 12px; border: 1px solid #d0d7e6; }
  tr:nth-child(even) { background: #f0f4ff; }
  .cover { text-align: center; padding: 50px 30px; border: 3px solid #0f3460; border-radius: 12px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #eef2ff, #fce7f3); margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .design-note { background: #fffbe6; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; padding: 10px 14px; margin: 10px 0; font-style: italic; font-size: 10pt; color: #78350f; }
  .speaker-note { background: #f0fdf4; border-left: 4px solid #22c55e; padding: 10px 14px; margin: 10px 0; font-size: 10pt; color: #14532d; }
  ul { margin: 6px 0 10px 20px; }
  li { margin: 4px 0; }
  .divider { text-align: center; font-size: 20pt; color: #c0c8d8; margin: 30px 0; letter-spacing: 10px; }
  p { margin: 6px 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- COVER -->
<div class="cover">
  <h1 style="border:none; font-size: 30pt; margin: 0;">🛡️ FINORA AI</h1>
  <p style="font-size: 14pt; color: #0f3460; font-weight: bold; margin: 10px 0;">Intelligent Financial Management for Indian Retail Businesses</p>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt; color: #555;">PowerPoint Presentation Content Guide</p>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt; color: #888; margin-top: 20px;">Use this document as the blueprint for your final PPT slides.<br>Each numbered section = one PowerPoint slide.</p>
</div>

<h1>🎨 Presentation Design Instructions</h1>
<table>
  <tr><th>Element</th><th>Recommendation</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Theme Color 1 (Primary)</td><td>#0f3460 (Deep Navy Blue)</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Theme Color 2 (Accent)</td><td>#e94560 (Vibrant Red / Coral)</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Theme Color 3 (Highlight)</td><td>#00d9c0 (Teal / Cyan)</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Background</td><td>Dark mode preferred: #0a0d14 or Light: #f8faff</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Font (Title)</td><td>Inter Bold or Calibri Bold, 28-36pt</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Font (Body)</td><td>Inter Regular or Calibri, 18-22pt</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Slide Count</td><td>15–18 slides (including cover + Q&amp;A)</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Duration</td><td>15–20 minutes presentation</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Icons</td><td>Use flat icons (Flaticon / Feather Icons set)</td></tr>
</table>

<div class="divider">― ◆ ―</div>

<!-- SLIDE 1 -->
<div class="slide-box">
  <span class="slide-number">1</span>
  <span class="slide-title">Title Slide — Opening Impact</span>
  <span class="slide-type">Cover Slide</span>
  <br><br>
  <div class="bullet-main">🛡️ FINORA AI</div>
  <p class="bullet-sub">Subtitle: <em>Intelligent Financial Management Platform for Indian Retail &amp; FMCG Businesses</em></p>
  <p class="bullet-sub">Tagline: <strong>"From Invoices to Insights — All in One Place"</strong></p>
  <br>
  <p class="bullet-sub">Presented by: [Your Team Name]</p>
  <p class="bullet-sub">Institution: [College/Organization Name]</p>
  <p class="bullet-sub">Date: August 2026</p>
  <div class="design-note">Design: Full-width dark background with glowing blue shield icon. Product name in large white bold text. Subtle animated particle/gradient recommended.</div>
</div>

<!-- SLIDE 2 -->
<div class="slide-box">
  <span class="slide-number">2</span>
  <span class="slide-title">The Problem We Solve</span>
  <span class="slide-type">Problem Statement</span>
  <br><br>
  <div class="bullet-main">🚨 Pain Points Faced by Indian Retail &amp; Small Business Owners:</div>
  <ul>
    <li class="bullet-sub">📄 <strong>Manual invoice management</strong> — prone to errors, duplicates, fraud</li>
    <li class="bullet-sub">📦 <strong>No real-time stock visibility</strong> — overstocking or running out of items</li>
    <li class="bullet-sub">💸 <strong>Untracked expenses and poor cash flow control</strong></li>
    <li class="bullet-sub">👥 <strong>Disconnected employee/salary management</strong></li>
    <li class="bullet-sub">🧾 <strong>GST confusion and compliance risks</strong></li>
    <li class="bullet-sub">🤖 <strong>No AI-powered business advice available for small stores</strong></li>
    <li class="bullet-sub">🔐 <strong>Data leakage risk when multiple employees share the same system</strong></li>
  </ul>
  <div class="design-note">Design: 3-column icon card layout showing "Chaos Before Finora". Red warning icons per point. Left side: overwhelmed shopkeeper illustration.</div>
  <div class="speaker-note">Speaker Note: "Today's small business owner is managing 5 different notebooks, WhatsApp messages, and spreadsheets. There's a better way."</div>
</div>

<!-- SLIDE 3 -->
<div class="slide-box">
  <span class="slide-number">3</span>
  <span class="slide-title">Our Solution — Finora AI</span>
  <span class="slide-type">Solution Overview</span>
  <br><br>
  <div class="bullet-main">✅ One Unified AI-Powered Business Platform</div>
  <ul>
    <li class="bullet-sub">An all-in-one web platform for financial management, built specifically for Indian retail</li>
    <li class="bullet-sub">Combines <strong>OCR Invoice Scanning</strong>, <strong>Live Inventory Tracking</strong>, <strong>POS Billing</strong>, <strong>AI Analytics</strong>, and <strong>Automated Reporting</strong></li>
    <li class="bullet-sub">Accessible from any device — desktop, tablet, or mobile browser</li>
    <li class="bullet-sub">Designed for <strong>Business Owners</strong> and their <strong>Employees</strong> with controlled access</li>
  </ul>
  <br>
  <div class="bullet-main">🎯 Core Value Proposition:</div>
  <ul>
    <li class="bullet-sub">🔍 <strong>Detect</strong> duplicate and fraudulent invoices automatically</li>
    <li class="bullet-sub">📊 <strong>Analyze</strong> your business with 4 AI models in real-time</li>
    <li class="bullet-sub">🤖 <strong>Automate</strong> reports and reminders to your workflow</li>
    <li class="bullet-sub">🔐 <strong>Secure</strong> data isolation per business — no cross-shop leaks</li>
  </ul>
  <div class="design-note">Design: Split slide — Left: old way (cluttered icons), Right: Finora solution (clean cards, glowing AI icon). Central "vs" divider with animated transition.</div>
</div>

<!-- SLIDE 4 -->
<div class="slide-box">
  <span class="slide-number">4</span>
  <span class="slide-title">Key Features at a Glance</span>
  <span class="slide-type">Feature Overview</span>
  <br><br>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <th>Module</th><th>What It Does</th>
    </tr>
    <tr><td>🧾 OCR Invoice Scanner</td><td>Scan vendor bills with camera/upload — AI extracts all data automatically</td></tr>
    <tr><td>📊 Business Dashboard</td><td>Live KPI cards: Revenue, Profit, Pending Bills, Stock Alerts</td></tr>
    <tr><td>🛒 POS Billing System</td><td>Fast customer checkout with barcode scan, credit/paid modes</td></tr>
    <tr><td>📦 Inventory Management</td><td>Real-time stock tracking, auto low-stock alerts, reorder suggestions</td></tr>
    <tr><td>💰 Expense & P&amp;L Tracker</td><td>Record expenses, auto-deduct salaries, track net profit</td></tr>
    <tr><td>👥 Employee Management</td><td>Add staff, assign roles, process salary with one click</td></tr>
    <tr><td>🤖 AI Assistant (4 Models)</td><td>Finance, Inventory, Vendor, Fraud &amp; Growth advisors</td></tr>
    <tr><td>📤 Automated Reports</td><td>2-day, weekly reports + reminders sent to your workflow app</td></tr>
    <tr><td>🔐 Role-Based Security</td><td>Owner sees everything; employees see only what they need</td></tr>
  </table>
  <div class="design-note">Design: 3x3 feature icon grid with hover animations. Each tile has a colored icon + short headline. Use teal/navy alternating tile backgrounds.</div>
</div>

<!-- SLIDE 5 -->
<div class="slide-box">
  <span class="slide-number">5</span>
  <span class="slide-title">Technology Stack</span>
  <span class="slide-type">Technical Architecture</span>
  <br><br>
  <table>
    <tr><th>Layer</th><th>Technology</th><th>Why We Chose It</th></tr>
    <tr><td>Frontend</td><td><span class="tag tag-tech">React 18</span> + <span class="tag tag-tech">Vite</span></td><td>Fast, modern UI with component-based architecture</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Backend</td><td><span class="tag tag-tech">Node.js</span> + <span class="tag tag-tech">Express.js</span></td><td>Lightweight, fast REST API server for Indian bandwidth conditions</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Database</td><td><span class="tag tag-tech">JSON DB</span> + <span class="tag tag-tech">Supabase</span></td><td>Local-first with cloud sync capability</td></tr>
    <tr><td>AI Engine</td><td><span class="tag tag-ai">Groq API</span> — llama3-8b-8192</td><td>Ultra-fast inference, 4 specialized models</td></tr>
    <tr><td>OCR</td><td><span class="tag tag-ai">Tesseract.js</span> + <span class="tag tag-ai">NVIDIA Vision AI</span></td><td>Dual-engine for high accuracy invoice scanning</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Automation</td><td><span class="tag tag-biz">Webhooks</span> → SNS iHub</td><td>Real-time reports to existing business workflow tools</td></tr>
  </table>
  <br>
  <div class="bullet-main">Architecture Diagram Flow:</div>
  <p class="bullet-sub">Browser (React) → Express API (Node.js) → JSON Database → [Groq AI / Tesseract OCR / Supabase Cloud / Webhook Engine]</p>
  <div class="design-note">Design: Layered architecture diagram. 5 horizontal bars stacked (Frontend → Backend → DB → AI → Webhook). Connected with animated flow arrows.</div>
</div>

<!-- SLIDE 6 -->
<div class="slide-box">
  <span class="slide-number">6</span>
  <span class="slide-title">OCR Invoice Intelligence</span>
  <span class="slide-type">Feature Deep Dive</span>
  <br><br>
  <div class="bullet-main">📸 How It Works — 4 Steps:</div>
  <ul>
    <li class="bullet-sub"><strong>Step 1 — Upload:</strong> Owner/staff takes a photo or uploads a scanned vendor bill (JPG/PNG/PDF)</li>
    <li class="bullet-sub"><strong>Step 2 — Scan:</strong> Tesseract.js extracts raw text from the image using OCR</li>
    <li class="bullet-sub"><strong>Step 3 — Parse:</strong> NVIDIA Vision AI structures the data — supplier name, invoice number, items, quantities, GST, total amount</li>
    <li class="bullet-sub"><strong>Step 4 — Validate:</strong> System checks for duplicates in real-time. If duplicate found → flagged as HIGH RISK with an alert</li>
  </ul>
  <br>
  <div class="bullet-main">🔴 Duplicate / Fraud Detection Logic:</div>
  <ul>
    <li class="bullet-sub">Check 1: Same invoice number already exists → Duplicate alert</li>
    <li class="bullet-sub">Check 2: Same supplier + same amount (within ₹5 tolerance) → Duplicate alert</li>
    <li class="bullet-sub">Fraud alert is auto-created and shown on the security dashboard</li>
  </ul>
  <div class="design-note">Design: Flow diagram with 4 step cards (camera → OCR text → JSON data → green/red check). Show before/after: blurry bill image → clean extracted table.</div>
  <div class="speaker-note">Speaker Note: "We save the business owner from paying the same vendor twice — a common ₹50,000+ mistake in Indian SMEs."</div>
</div>

<!-- SLIDE 7 -->
<div class="slide-box">
  <span class="slide-number">7</span>
  <span class="slide-title">AI Assistant — 4 Specialized Business Models</span>
  <span class="slide-type">AI Feature Deep Dive</span>
  <br><br>
  <table>
    <tr><th>AI Model</th><th>Name</th><th>What It Analyzes</th><th>Sample Query</th></tr>
    <tr><td>💹 Finance</td><td>Finance Analyst</td><td>P&amp;L, cash flow, GST, tax optimization</td><td>"What is my profit margin this month?"</td></tr>
    <tr><td>📦 Inventory</td><td>Stock Manager</td><td>Low stock, dead stock, reorder quantities</td><td>"Which items should I reorder this week?"</td></tr>
    <tr><td>🏭 Vendor</td><td>Vendor Advisor</td><td>Supplier comparison, bulk pricing, history</td><td>"Which vendor gives me the best deal on oil?"</td></tr>
    <tr><td>🚨 Fraud &amp; Growth</td><td>Growth Advisor</td><td>Security alerts, duplicate bills, marketing strategy</td><td>"How can I grow my sales by 20% next month?"</td></tr>
  </table>
  <br>
  <div class="bullet-main">🔑 Key Technical Detail:</div>
  <ul>
    <li class="bullet-sub">Each model uses a <strong>separate Groq API key</strong> for isolation and quota management</li>
    <li class="bullet-sub">Each AI receives <strong>live, real-time store data</strong> as context — not generic answers</li>
    <li class="bullet-sub">If API unavailable, <strong>offline fallback</strong> provides data-based summary automatically</li>
  </ul>
  <div class="design-note">Design: 4 glowing cards in 2x2 grid. Each card has icon, model name, and 2-3 example questions. Neural network background animation behind the grid.</div>
</div>

<!-- SLIDE 8 -->
<div class="slide-box">
  <span class="slide-number">8</span>
  <span class="slide-title">POS Billing & Customer Management</span>
  <span class="slide-type">Feature Deep Dive</span>
  <br><br>
  <div class="bullet-main">🛒 Point of Sale System Features:</div>
  <ul>
    <li class="bullet-sub">Barcode scanner integration for instant item lookup</li>
    <li class="bullet-sub">Cart management — add/remove items, auto-calculate subtotal + 18% GST</li>
    <li class="bullet-sub">Two payment modes:
      <ul>
        <li><strong>💚 Paid Now</strong> — transaction recorded instantly as income</li>
        <li><strong>🟡 Credit / Pending</strong> — bill saved with due date for later collection</li>
      </ul>
    </li>
    <li class="bullet-sub">Generates numbered bill (e.g., BILL-482931) with customer details</li>
  </ul>
  <br>
  <div class="bullet-main">📋 Pending Bills Manager:</div>
  <ul>
    <li class="bullet-sub">Dashboard shows live count of pending credit bills (clickable → opens full list)</li>
    <li class="bullet-sub">Color-coded due dates — red (overdue), yellow (due within 3 days)</li>
    <li class="bullet-sub">One-click "Settle Bill" updates status and records income transaction</li>
  </ul>
  <div class="design-note">Design: Split screen — Left: POS checkout mockup with cart items, Right: Pending bills list with colored due dates. Show bill creation animation.</div>
</div>

<!-- SLIDE 9 -->
<div class="slide-box">
  <span class="slide-number">9</span>
  <span class="slide-title">Role-Based Access Control — Security Architecture</span>
  <span class="slide-type">Security Feature</span>
  <br><br>
  <div class="bullet-main">🔐 Strict Data Isolation — No Cross-Business Data Leakage</div>
  <ul>
    <li class="bullet-sub">Every database query is scoped to the owner's unique <strong>Shop ID</strong></li>
    <li class="bullet-sub">Employees created by Business Owner A <strong>can ONLY see Shop A's data</strong></li>
    <li class="bullet-sub">All API routes check both <strong>role permission</strong> AND <strong>shop ID</strong> before returning any data</li>
  </ul>
  <br>
  <table>
    <tr><th>Role</th><th>Dashboard Access</th><th>Can See Analytics?</th><th>Can Manage Staff?</th></tr>
    <tr><td>🏢 Business Owner</td><td>Full — All Modules</td><td>✅ Yes</td><td>✅ Yes</td></tr>
    <tr><td>🛒 Cashier</td><td>POS, Pending Bills, Stock View</td><td>❌ No</td><td>❌ No</td></tr>
    <tr><td>💼 Financier</td><td>Invoices, Expenses, Transactions</td><td>⚠️ Limited</td><td>❌ No</td></tr>
    <tr><td>📦 Store Manager</td><td>Inventory, POS, Vendors</td><td>❌ No</td><td>❌ No</td></tr>
    <tr><td>📒 Accountant</td><td>Transactions, Expenses, Reports</td><td>⚠️ Limited</td><td>❌ No</td></tr>
  </table>
  <div class="design-note">Design: Concentric circles or tree diagram showing Owner at center with branches for each role. Color-coded permissions matrix table.</div>
</div>

<!-- SLIDE 10 -->
<div class="slide-box">
  <span class="slide-number">10</span>
  <span class="slide-title">Automated Reports & Webhook Integration</span>
  <span class="slide-type">Automation Feature</span>
  <br><br>
  <div class="bullet-main">📤 4 One-Click Report Actions (Settings → App Preferences):</div>
  <br>
  <table>
    <tr><th>Button</th><th>Action</th><th>Sent To</th></tr>
    <tr><td>📊 Send 2-Day Report</td><td>Analyze last 48 hrs: sales, bills, alerts</td><td>Webhook URL (SNS iHub workflow)</td></tr>
    <tr><td>📈 Weekly Report</td><td>7-day summary + Groq AI executive analysis</td><td>Webhook URL (SNS iHub workflow)</td></tr>
    <tr><td>🔔 Send Reminders</td><td>Salary due, overdue customer bills, low stock alerts</td><td>Webhook URL (SNS iHub workflow)</td></tr>
    <tr><td>🚀 Growth Advice</td><td>AI-generated 5 growth strategies for the store</td><td>Webhook URL + shown in AI module</td></tr>
  </table>
  <br>
  <div class="bullet-main">⚡ How Webhooks Work:</div>
  <ul>
    <li class="bullet-sub">Each action compiles a structured JSON payload from live store data</li>
    <li class="bullet-sub">Payload is POST-ed to the configured SNS iHub workflow URL</li>
    <li class="bullet-sub">Business owner receives the report in their connected workflow tool (WhatsApp, Slack, Email, etc.)</li>
  </ul>
  <div class="design-note">Design: Flow diagram — Finora AI button click → JSON payload → webhook arrow → SNS iHub platform → notification on phone. Animated flow lines.</div>
</div>

<!-- SLIDE 11 -->
<div class="slide-box">
  <span class="slide-number">11</span>
  <span class="slide-title">Employee & Salary Management</span>
  <span class="slide-type">Feature Deep Dive</span>
  <br><br>
  <div class="bullet-main">👥 End-to-End Staff Management in Finora:</div>
  <ul>
    <li class="bullet-sub"><strong>Add Employee:</strong> Name, role, phone number, monthly salary, salary due date</li>
    <li class="bullet-sub"><strong>Employee Login:</strong> Staff get their own login — scoped to only the owner's shop data</li>
    <li class="bullet-sub"><strong>Salary Payout:</strong> One-click "Settle Salary" button — auto-creates expense record, transaction log, and payment history</li>
    <li class="bullet-sub"><strong>Salary Reminders:</strong> Auto-alert generated 3 days before salary due date</li>
    <li class="bullet-sub"><strong>Payment History:</strong> Full trail of all past salary payments per employee</li>
  </ul>
  <br>
  <div class="bullet-main">📊 Impact on P&amp;L:</div>
  <ul>
    <li class="bullet-sub">Every salary payout is automatically deducted from profit — no manual expense entry needed</li>
    <li class="bullet-sub">Transaction ledger shows each payout as an OUT entry with employee name</li>
  </ul>
  <div class="design-note">Design: Employee card UI mockup showing profile pic placeholder, name, role, salary amount, and settle button. Next to it: payment history timeline.</div>
</div>

<!-- SLIDE 12 -->
<div class="slide-box">
