    <li class="bullet-sub">🚨 AI Intelligence Feed (fraud alerts, GST compliance status)</li>
    <li class="bullet-sub">⚡ Quick Actions — Upload Invoice, Create Bill, Add Employee, Generate Report</li>
    <li class="bullet-sub">👥 Recent activity log — all changes with timestamps</li>
  </ul>
  <div class="design-note">Design: Use actual screenshot of the dashboard if available. Alternatively create a clean mockup with dark theme, 4 colored KPI cards at top, chart below.</div>
</div>

<!-- SLIDE 13 -->
<div class="slide-box">
  <span class="slide-number">13</span>
  <span class="slide-title">Target Market & Use Cases</span>
  <span class="slide-type">Market Fit</span>
  <br><br>
  <div class="bullet-main">🎯 Primary Target Users:</div>
  <ul>
    <li class="bullet-sub">🏪 <strong>Kirana Stores &amp; Supermarkets</strong> — 1–10 employees, ₹5L–₹50L monthly turnover</li>
    <li class="bullet-sub">🛒 <strong>FMCG Distributors &amp; Wholesale Shops</strong> — high vendor bill volume, need duplicate detection</li>
    <li class="bullet-sub">🍲 <strong>Restaurants &amp; Food Businesses</strong> — daily POS billing, inventory tracking</li>
    <li class="bullet-sub">🧴 <strong>Pharmacy &amp; Medical Stores</strong> — strict inventory tracking, GST compliance</li>
    <li class="bullet-sub">👗 <strong>Fashion Retail &amp; Boutiques</strong> — POS billing, vendor management</li>
  </ul>
  <br>
  <div class="bullet-main">📈 Market Size:</div>
  <ul>
    <li class="bullet-sub">63 million+ MSMEs in India (Ministry of MSME, 2024)</li>
    <li class="bullet-sub">Only 14% use any form of digital accounting software</li>
    <li class="bullet-sub">Opportunity: 54 million unserved businesses in India</li>
  </ul>
  <div class="design-note">Design: India map with business category icons pinned across it. Market size numbers in large bold counters. Pie chart showing 14% served vs 86% unserved.</div>
</div>

<!-- SLIDE 14 -->
<div class="slide-box">
  <span class="slide-number">14</span>
  <span class="slide-title">Competitive Advantage</span>
  <span class="slide-type">Differentiation</span>
  <br><br>
