<!-- APPENDIX -->
<h1>📎 Appendix — Additional Talking Points</h1>

<h3>Frequently Asked Questions (For Q&amp;A Prep)</h3>
<table>
  <tr><th>Question</th><th>Suggested Answer</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Is the data secure?</td><td>Yes. Each business owner's data is strictly isolated using a unique shop ID. Employees from one shop cannot access another shop's data. All routes validate both role and shop identity.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>What happens if AI API is offline?</td><td>Finora has a built-in offline fallback that generates a data-based summary from real-time store data without requiring the AI API — so the system always works.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>How does OCR accuracy compare to manual entry?</td><td>The dual-engine approach (Tesseract + NVIDIA) achieves ~90%+ accuracy. Extracted data is shown to the user for review before saving, ensuring no data is saved blindly.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Can it integrate with existing accounting software?</td><td>Via webhooks, any data from Finora can be sent to external systems including Tally, ERP, or any tool that accepts HTTP POST payloads.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>How many employees can be added?</td><td>Unlimited. Each employee gets their own login and automatically sees only their assigned shop's data.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Does it support multiple shops?</td><td>Currently one shop per owner account. Multi-branch support is planned in Phase 2.</td></tr>
</table>

<h3>Key Numbers for the Presentation</h3>
<ul>
  <li>13 Backend API routes covering all business functions</li>
  <li>37+ API service functions in the frontend</li>
  <li>4 specialized AI models for different business domains</li>
  <li>5 user roles with granular permissions</li>
  <li>12 database tables tracking all business data</li>
  <li>4 automated report types sent to webhook</li>
  <li>2 OCR engines for high-accuracy invoice scanning</li>
  <li>100% tenant data isolation — no cross-business data access</li>
</ul>

